The '''Dormitory''' is unlocked during the tutorial section of [[Freshleigh Meadows]], and is used to provide [[Students]] with accommodation.

==Description==
===Function===
Accommodation is automatically assigned to [[Students]], who will pay rent each month for the privilege. They can use the space to sleep and regain their energy, and will be happier when it is decorated. At least 1 bed is advised for each 5 students. Permission to use a dormitory can be set by sex and [[Courses|course]].

===Appearance===
The door to this room is a plain midtone wood, with four sunken panels in a 2x2 grid shape.

